WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
Authored guidance with offline synthetic narration.

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.130
Change the ratio.

3
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.570
The front gear has 48 teeth and turns at 30 revolutions per minute.

4
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.915
Each full turn advances 48 chain pitches.

5
00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:17.470
The ideal no-slip chain carries the same chain pitches past both gears.

6
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.550
Take apart pauses motion for inspection.

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.845
Cancel restores the entry view; Put back restores the assembly.

8
00:00:25.095 --> 00:00:27.790
Pulling does not disconnect the model.

9
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.215
The rear gear has 16 teeth.

10
00:00:30.465 --> 00:00:36.380
Rear speed = 30  times  48  divided by  16 = 90 revolutions per minute.

11
00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.800
Change a supported setting and observe the result.

12
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:43.950
Force, torque, slip and road speed are outside this model.

13
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.253
Prepared context only. Nothing sent. Live ChatGPT answers and new creation remain unavailable.

